    task: "Northgate Broadband sets case SLAs from the customer's tier (Account.SLA_Tier__c: 'Gold', 'Silver', 'Bronze').\nWrite `CaseTrigger` (before insert) that calls `CaseTriggerHandler.applySla(Trigger.new)`, and the handler method `public static void applySla(List<Case> cases)`:\n- Gold: SLA_Due__c = now + 4 hours, priority 'High'\n- Silver: now + 24 hours, 'Medium'\n- Bronze, no tier or no account: now + 72 hours, 'Low'\n- Only set Priority if it is blank; always set SLA_Due__c\n- One SOQL query at most, none when no case has an account",
    starter: "trigger CaseTrigger on Case (before insert) {\n    // TODO: delegate to the handler\n}\n\npublic with sharing class CaseTriggerHandler {\n    public static void applySla(List<Case> cases) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "trigger CaseTrigger on Case (before insert) {\n    CaseTriggerHandler.applySla(Trigger.new);\n}\n\npublic with sharing class CaseTriggerHandler {\n    public static void applySla(List<Case> cases) {\n        Set<Id> accountIds = new Set<Id>();\n        for (Case c : cases) {\n            if (c.AccountId != null) {\n                accountIds.add(c.AccountId);\n            }\n        }\n        Map<Id, Account> accounts = new Map<Id, Account>();\n        if (!accountIds.isEmpty()) {\n            accounts = new Map<Id, Account>([\n                SELECT Id, SLA_Tier__c FROM Account WHERE Id IN :accountIds\n            ]);\n        }\n\n        Datetime nowTime = Datetime.now();\n        for (Case c : cases) {\n            Account acc = accounts.get(c.AccountId);\n            String tier = acc == null ? null : acc.SLA_Tier__c;\n            Integer hours = 72;\n            String priority = 'Low';\n            if (tier == 'Gold') {\n                hours = 4;\n                priority = 'High';\n            } else if (tier == 'Silver') {\n                hours = 24;\n                priority = 'Medium';\n            }\n            c.SLA_Due__c = nowTime.addHours(hours);\n            if (String.isBlank(c.Priority)) {\n                c.Priority = priority;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
