    starter: "trigger CaseTrigger on Case (before update) {\n    // TODO\n}\n\npublic with sharing class CaseTriggerHandler {\n    public static void preventCloseWithOpenTasks(List<Case> newCases, Map<Id, Case> oldMap) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "trigger CaseTrigger on Case (before update) {\n    CaseTriggerHandler.preventCloseWithOpenTasks(Trigger.new, Trigger.oldMap);\n}\n\npublic with sharing class CaseTriggerHandler {\n    public static void preventCloseWithOpenTasks(List<Case> newCases, Map<Id, Case> oldMap) {\n        Set<Id> closingIds = new Set<Id>();\n        for (Case c : newCases) {\n            if (c.Status == 'Closed' && oldMap.get(c.Id).Status != 'Closed') {\n                closingIds.add(c.Id);\n            }\n        }\n        if (closingIds.isEmpty()) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        Set<Id> withOpenTasks = new Set<Id>();\n        for (AggregateResult ar : [\n            SELECT WhatId FROM Task\n            WHERE WhatId IN :closingIds AND IsClosed = false\n            GROUP BY WhatId\n        ]) {\n            withOpenTasks.add((Id) ar.get('WhatId'));\n        }\n\n        for (Case c : newCases) {\n            if (withOpenTasks.contains(c.Id)) {\n                c.addError('Close all open tasks before closing this case.');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
