    task: "Merrow Pension Advisers wants every new opportunity linked to the account's primary contact.\nWrite `OpportunityTriggerHandler.addPrimaryContactRoles(List<Opportunity> opps)` called from after insert:\n- Find each account's contact with Primary_Contact__c = true (if several, the oldest by CreatedDate wins)\n- Create an OpportunityContactRole: OpportunityId, ContactId, Role 'Decision Maker', IsPrimary = true\n- Skip opportunities without an account or without a primary contact\n- One query and one DML",
    starter: "public with sharing class OpportunityTriggerHandler {\n    public static void addPrimaryContactRoles(List<Opportunity> opps) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "public with sharing class OpportunityTriggerHandler {\n    public static void addPrimaryContactRoles(List<Opportunity> opps) {\n        Set<Id> accountIds = new Set<Id>();\n        for (Opportunity opp : opps) {\n            if (opp.AccountId != null) {\n                accountIds.add(opp.AccountId);\n            }\n        }\n        if (accountIds.isEmpty()) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        Map<Id, Id> primaryByAccount = new Map<Id, Id>();\n        for (Contact c : [\n            SELECT Id, AccountId FROM Contact\n            WHERE AccountId IN :accountIds AND Primary_Contact__c = true\n            ORDER BY CreatedDate ASC\n        ]) {\n            if (!primaryByAccount.containsKey(c.AccountId)) {\n                primaryByAccount.put(c.AccountId, c.Id);\n            }\n        }\n\n        List<OpportunityContactRole> roles = new List<OpportunityContactRole>();\n        for (Opportunity opp : opps) {\n            Id contactId = primaryByAccount.get(opp.AccountId);\n            if (contactId != null) {\n                roles.add(new OpportunityContactRole(\n                    OpportunityId = opp.Id,\n                    ContactId = contactId,\n                    Role = 'Decision Maker',\n                    IsPrimary = true\n                ));\n            }\n        }\n        if (!roles.isEmpty()) {\n            insert roles;\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
